New package: irqbalance

Irqbalance is a daemon to help balance the cpu load generated by interrupts
across all of a systems cpus.

Signed-off-by: Karoly Kasza <kaszak@gmail.com>
---
 package/Config.in                     |    1 +
 package/irqbalance/Config.in          |    9 +++++++++
 package/irqbalance/S13irqbalance      |   34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 package/irqbalance/irqbalance.mk      |   35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 package/irqbalance/irqbalance.service |    9 +++++++++
 5 files changed, 88 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 package/irqbalance/Config.in
 create mode 100644 package/irqbalance/S13irqbalance
 create mode 100644 package/irqbalance/irqbalance.mk
